# Boss: Mister Frog. A big candy-purple frog, squat and grinning, with bulging
# eyes and a tall white top hat with a red band. Twice a player's size, with a
# square footprint. Built from simple shapes (an ellipsoid body, a cylinder hat)
# by a generator.
